    "_comment": "Copy this file to telegram_config.json and fill in the values. telegram_config.json is gitignored.",
    "_how_to": [
        "1. Open Telegram, message @BotFather, run /newbot, and copy the bot token.",
        "2. Send any message to your new bot (so it can message you back).",
